errors: section {
  @status(503)
  @display("Language server not running")
  server_not_running: error("vscode.SERVER_NOT_RUNNING") {
    title = "can't start `{command} lsp`"
    command: String
    | Shown as an error message, with an action that opens the `heron.path` setting.
    | Reported as [tools.vscode.fixing.fix_a_diagnostic.1a] says.
  }
}
